              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Nuclear Proliferation is a commercial satirical card game where players use cards to try to eliminate each other."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Flying Buffalo in 1992, Nuclear Proliferation is another entry in the satirical nuclear-war card-game family and uses proprietary attack and event cards."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
