              "text": "2-6 players use the table arrangement described for Nuclear Proliferation."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Nuclear Proliferation card deck"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Nuclear Proliferation card deck, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare the dedicated Nuclear Proliferation cards and any shared table, score, or resource areas from the published rules."
